            "review_title": "Review at Embers & Leaves Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ESee\nSingapore, Singapore4 contributions\n0\nA Heartfelt Thank You to THOMAS\nJul 2026 • Family\nWe would like to express our sincere appreciation to Thomas, the Restaurant Manager for his exceptional service during our stay.\n\nThomas was incredibly attentive, warm, and thoughtful throughout our breakfast visits. He went above and beyond to assist our elderly parents, always ensuring they were comfortable and well looked after. His kindness, patience and genuine care made a meaningful difference to our dining experience.\n\nWe are truly grateful for his friendly support and outstanding hospitality. Thomas is a wonderful ambassador for your restaurant and we hope our heartfelt thanks are passed on to him.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThe staff team was attentive & always ready to help. The beef pho was delicious, flavorful & comforting. We look forward to visit again.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 15, 2026",
